=2 Walkthrough
!Maze of Shakhrami-map1.jpg|right|Maze of Shakhrami
* {n:Kurou-Morou} is the fortune teller in {z:Lower Jeuno} above the Auction House. He asks you to bring him a Crystal Ball.
* To create a Crystal Ball, you need an {i:Ahriman Lens|Ahriman Lens|557}.
** The {@i:Ahriman Lens|557} {i:Ahriman Lens|Ahriman Lens|557} is an Ex item, so you can't find it on the AH.
** You'll need to defeat Evil Eye type mobs to get one to drop.
*** The Eyes spawn in areas such as {z:Ranguemont Pass}, {z:Beaucedine Glacier}, and {z:Xarcabard}.
* With the Lens in your possession, head to the {z:Maze of Shakhrami}.
* Go to (G-5) on the first map, which is east of the exit to {z:Attohwa Chasm}.
** The fastest way here is the Voidwatch Warp to Tavnazia -> {z:Attohwa Chasm} using the teleport service from any {p:Atmacite Refiner}, then go south to zone into {z:Maze of Shakhrami}.
*** Can be unlocked by 75+ players with access to {z:Tavnazian Safehold} by talking to {n:Owain} to get a {k:Hyacinth stratum abyssite}; no {p:Voidwatch} battles or progression is necessary
*** The 1000 requisite cruor can be attained via a {i:Copper Voucher|Copper Voucher|8711}, killing fodder in {p:Abyssea}, or earned previously via Voidwatch.
* At the top of the path, you'll find a Rockwell.
* Trade your {@i:Ahriman Lens|557} {i:Ahriman Lens|Ahriman Lens|557} to the Rockwell, and you'll get the message "You submerged the Ahriman Lens into the pool of water."
* Wait one minute (Earth Time), then you'll be able to check the Rockwell to obtain your {@i:Divination Sphere|556} {i:Divination Sphere|Divination Sphere|556}
* Head back to {n:Kurou-Morou} and trade him your {@i:Divination Sphere|556} {i:Divination Sphere|Divination Sphere|556}. This finishes the quest, and as a reward, he will now tell your fortune when you request it.

